          "docs": "Used to initiate the authorisation process and direct users to the login screen of their financial Institution in order to give their consent for a payment. This endpoint is used to initiate all the different payment listed below. Based on the type of payment you wish to make, you may be required to provide specific properties in [PaymentRequest](/api-reference/createPaymentAuthorisation). First make sure that the payment feature you wish to execute is supported by the bank by checking the featu"
